#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/rgb.rs
msgid "RGB lighting: %1, OpenRGB server %2 (%3)"
msgstr "iluminación RGB: %1, servidor OpenRGB %2 (%3)"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/rgb.rs
