#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/server.rs
msgid "Withdraw a package of yours from the repository for good, after asking"
msgstr "Retirar para siempre un paquete tuyo del repositorio, tras preguntar"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/server.rs
msgid ""
"Withdraw a package of yours from the repository for good. Every published "
"version is revoked, so devices that installed it are told it was withdrawn "
"by its author, and its files are deleted from the server; this cannot be "
"undone. The id stays yours: you may upload a newer version later."
msgstr ""
"Retirar para siempre un paquete tuyo del repositorio. Se revoca cada versión "
"publicada, así que los dispositivos que lo instalaron saben que su autor lo "
"retiró, y sus archivos se borran del servidor; no se puede deshacer. El id "
"sigue siendo tuyo: más adelante puedes subir una versión más nueva."

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/server.rs
msgid "Withdraw without asking, for scripts"
msgstr "Retirar sin preguntar, para scripts"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/serving.rs
msgid "%1 is withdrawn"
msgstr "%1 está retirado"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/serving.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is withdrawn for good: every version is revoked and its files are deleted "
"from the server"
msgstr ""
"%1 se retira para siempre: se revoca cada versión y sus archivos se borran "
"del servidor"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/serving.rs
msgid "add --yes to withdraw it without asking"
msgstr "añade --yes para retirarlo sin preguntar"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/serving.rs
msgid "Withdraw it? [y/N] "
msgstr "¿Retirarlo? [s/N] "

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/serving.rs
msgid "nothing was withdrawn"
msgstr "no se retiró nada"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/cli.rs
msgid "Daily check of the AppImage for a new version, and whether it may run"
msgstr ""
"Comprobación diaria de versiones nuevas del AppImage, y si puede hacerse"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid ""
"Turn the daily check for a new version of the AppImage on or off, or tell "
"whether it is on (on by default; it asks GitHub for the latest release)"
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva la comprobación diaria de versiones nuevas del AppImage, "
"o di si está activada (lo está de forma predeterminada; pregunta a GitHub por "
"la última versión)"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid "on, off, or status to tell which"
msgstr "on, off, o status para decir cuál"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid ""
"Tell whether the updater of the AppImage may contact GitHub now: exits with "
"0 when it may, 1 when private mode is on or, with --auto, when the daily "
"check is off"
msgstr ""
"Di si el actualizador del AppImage puede contactar con GitHub ahora: sale "
"con 0 si puede, 1 si el modo privado está activado o, con --auto, si la "
"comprobación diaria está desactivada"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid "Ask for the daily check, which also needs its setting on"
msgstr "Pregunta por la comprobación diaria, que además necesita su ajuste activado"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid ""
"daily check for a new version: on (it asks GitHub for the latest release)"
msgstr ""
"comprobación diaria de versiones nuevas: activada (pregunta a GitHub por la "
"última versión)"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid "daily check for a new version: off"
msgstr "comprobación diaria de versiones nuevas: desactivada"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid "private mode is on: no check for a new version is made"
msgstr "el modo privado está activado: no se busca ninguna versión nueva"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/updating.rs
msgid ""
"the daily check for a new version is off: turn it on with `reiwand-ctl "
"update auto on`"
msgstr ""
"la comprobación diaria de versiones nuevas está desactivada: actívala con "
"`reiwand-ctl update auto on`"

#: apps/reiwand-ctl/src/locking.rs
